    <briefdescription>
<para>Plugin that blocks until a shared gate is released. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used by queue/backpressure tests so the first request stays in-flight while later requests accumulate in the pending queue deterministically. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
